## SECTION 12: MERMAID DIAGRAM STANDARDS

> **When to apply:** EVERY generated agent that emits Mermaid diagrams — which is effectively all of them, since the standard skeleton produces at least three: the Phase Orchestration `stateDiagram-v2`, the INDEX.md `Rule Dependency Map` (`flowchart TD`), and the INDEX.md `Phase Workflow` (`flowchart LR`). Agents whose deliverables include architecture/HLD/flow diagrams (Document Generator archetype, integration-adjacent agents) have additional diagram surfaces and need this section even more.

> **Canonical source:** `lib/docs/mermaid-diagram-best-practices.md` — ten non-negotiable rules, the mandatory `curve: 'linear'` init directive for flowcharts, deterministic layout via declaration order, arrow semantics (`-->` forward vs `-.->` return/async), edge-label discipline, subgraph patterns, Material Design 200/300 colour palette, and a pre-emit self-check.

### 12.1 What Agent Builder Must Do During Phase 3 / Phase 5 Generation

1. **Every generated rule file / doc that embeds a Mermaid diagram** MUST reference `lib/docs/mermaid-diagram-best-practices.md` (or the agent's own copy if self-contained) and include the canonical init directive at the top of every `flowchart`/`graph`.
2. **Every generated `stateDiagram-v2`** uses `[*]` for start/end, labels transitions with the trigger event (`user approved`), and declares states in phase/workflow order.
3. **Every generated `flowchart`** starts with `%%{ init: { 'flowchart': { 'curve': 'linear' } } }%%`, declares nodes upstream→downstream, orders connections primary-path→branching-path, uses `<br/>` (never `\n`) for line breaks, and puts all `style` declarations at the end of the block.
4. **Colour palette:** pick a coherent Material Design 200/300-level palette once per deliverable; assign colours by semantic role (source / target / middleware / event-bus / external / deprecated) — never alphabetically.
5. **For agents with deliverable-level diagrams** (e.g., Architect, HLD generators, Documentation agents): the generated Guidance file MUST carry a dedicated Mermaid section whose rules reference `lib/docs/mermaid-diagram-best-practices.md` §§2–14, adapted to the agent's domain vocabulary.

### 12.2 Embeddable Template — Mermaid Section in a Generated Agent's Guidance File

```markdown
